msgid "The message flow is::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:100
msgid "FSP message format"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:101
msgid ""
"All FSP messages share a common header format consisting of two 32-bit words:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:103
msgid "**MCTP header** (Management Component Transport Protocol):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:105
msgid "Bit 31: SOM (Start of Message)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:106
msgid "Bit 30: EOM (End of Message)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:107
msgid "Bits 29:28: Packet sequence number"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:108
msgid "Bits 23:16: Source Endpoint ID"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:110
msgid "**NVDM header** (NVIDIA Vendor Defined Message):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:112
msgid "Bits 6:0: MCTP message type (0x7e = vendor-defined PCI)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:113
msgid "Bits 23:8: PCI vendor ID (0x10de = NVIDIA)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:114
msgid "Bits 31:24: NVDM type (0x14 = COT, 0x13 = PRC, 0x15 = FSP response)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:117
msgid "PRC (Product Reconfiguration Control) protocol"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:118
msgid ""
"PRC is an API system exposed through FSP's Management Partition that allows "
"querying and modifying device configuration without firmware updates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:121
msgid ""
"Configuration parameters are called \"knobs\". Each knob has a unique object "
"ID and controls a specific device behavior. Examples include vGPU mode, ECC "
"enable, confidential computing mode, and NVLINK configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:125
msgid "Each knob has two values:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:127
msgid "**Active**: the currently effective value for this boot cycle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:128
msgid ""
"**Persistent**: the value stored in InfoROM, applied on subsequent boots."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:130
msgid ""
"The nova-core driver uses PRC to read the vGPU mode knob (object ID 0x29) "
"during early boot, before firmware loading, to determine whether the GPU "
"should operate in vGPU mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:134
msgid ""
"The PRC message format follows the same MCTP/NVDM header structure as COT, "
"with NVDM type 0x13. The payload contains:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:137
msgid "A sub-command (e.g., 0x0c for read)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:138
msgid ""
"Flags indicating which value to read (bit 0 = persistent, bit 1 = active)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:139
msgid "The knob object ID."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/fsp.rst:141
msgid ""
"The response includes the common FSP response header (with error status) "
"followed by the knob's 16-bit state value."
msgstr ""
